## Conventions

- Short sentences, plain words, English.
- A claim in a document says how it is known: **[observed]** (seen running), **[documented]** (from the tool's own
  documentation) or **[unverified]** (to check; listed under open questions).
- A document changes in the same commit as the code it describes.
- Dates are written `YYYY-MM-DD`.
